===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# {{lb|en|mathematics|geometry}} Of, pertaining to or derived from a [[polyhedron]].
# {{lb|en|geometry|of a [[solid]] or [[surface]]}} Having multiple [[planar]] [[face]]s or [[facet]]s.
# {{lb|en|aeronautics|of a fixed-wing [[aircraft]]}} Having multiple [[dihedral]] angles along the [[wingspan]].

